  "details": "1. Launch VRChat and full screen the app via Alt+Enter or the Fullscreen option in Graphics Settings.\n\n2. Close VRChat.\n\n3. Use VRC Quick Launcher with Auto-layout checked to launch more than 1 client profile.\n\n4. All clients launch in full screen, requiring the user to manually exit full screen before laying out the app windows.\n\nVRChat clients launched with VRC Quick Launcher will not automatically exit full screen to allow for window layout. Requiring manual intervention on each individual client. It is expected that the apps would automatically exit full screen to allow auto-layout to function.",
